<title>USA: Oldham Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Wm. R. Hough.</title>
<headline>Oldham Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Wm. R. Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wm. R. Hough said it won $7.350 million of Oldham Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.12 percent.</p>
